---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ProofPoint from "../components/ProofPoint.astro";
import VoiceWidget from "../components/VoiceWidget.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="AI-Native Independent Insurance, Human-Bound"
  description="Protection Partners is a Florida independent insurance agency built around commercial and business auto coverage, backed by licensed producers who quote fast and bind every policy themselves."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-ink/10 bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:py-28">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brass">
          Florida independent insurance agency
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl leading-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
          AI-native independent insurance, human-bound.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate">
          We use AI to compress the slow parts of insurance shopping —
          intake, carrier matching, paperwork — down to minutes. Every quote
          is still reviewed, and every policy is still bound, by a licensed
          Florida producer who knows your risk. Commercial, business auto,
          and personal lines, from an agency built for how fast your
          business actually moves.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/get-a-quote"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-brass hover:text-ink"
          >
            Get a Quote →
          </a>
          <VoiceWidget />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative border border-ink/10 bg-ink p-8 text-paper shadow-xl">
        <p class="font-display text-lg text-brass">Why agencies like ours exist</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/85">
          <li>— No 40-field PDF before you get a call back.</li>
          <li>— No CSR reading your risk off a script.</li>
          <li>— A producer who already has your numbers when they call.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-6 border-t border-paper/15 pt-4 text-xs text-paper/60">
          A licensed producer reviews and completes every quote. This site
          never binds coverage or collects payment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl">Built to move at your speed</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate">
        Three things separate Protection Partners from the mega-menu agency
        sites: speed, licensing, and specialty.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <ProofPoint
        number="01"
        title="Speed-to-quote"
        body="Our intake is a five-minute form, not a phone tag exercise. AI structures your submission the moment you hit send so a producer opens your file already knowing your risk."
      />
      <ProofPoint
        number="02"
        title="Licensed FL producers bind every policy"
        body="Nothing this site collects becomes a bound policy on its own. A Florida-licensed producer reviews every submission, quotes it against real carriers, and is the one who binds it."
      />
      <ProofPoint
        number="03"
        title="Commercial + business auto specialty"
        body="We built this agency around the coverage general agencies treat as an afterthought — commercial auto, fleet, and business property for operators who can't afford a lapse."
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-ink/10 bg-ink/95 py-16 text-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brass">Carriers</p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-paper/70">
        [CARRIER LOGOS PENDING APPOINTMENTS] — carrier relationships are being
        finalized. This row will list our appointed carriers once contracts
        are signed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 text-center sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl">Ready when you are</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate">
      Tell us about your business or your household once. A licensed producer
      takes it from there.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/get-a-quote"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-brass hover:text-ink"
      >
        Get a Quote →
      </a>
      <VoiceWidget />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
